        "ch_optimised": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "kicker": "",
            "heading": "Everything is optimised except one thing",
            "text": "<p>Training periodised. Sleep protected. Drink cut. Protein, creatine, magnesium, vitamin D. Every one of those is a behaviour or a raw material - an instruction sent to the cell, or a delivery made to it.</p><p>None of them change the cell's capacity to act on any of it. That is the layer nobody optimises, because no wearable reports on it. It is also the layer that decides what all the rest converts into.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fig_training": {
