          "settings": {
            "kicker": "",
            "heading": "The part you can change",
            "text": "<p>Age is not negotiable. The input is. And unlike most things sold to people who train, this one lands somewhere you are already collecting data - your own overnight numbers, with months of baseline in them.</p><p>Which means you do not have to take anyone's word for it, including mine.</p>"
